{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56096","headline":"真人赞六首 一 · 杜光庭","name":"真人赞六首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大道难无甚，可以有情求。\n伫驾空洞中，回眄翳沧流。\n净明三界外，萧萧玉京游。\n自无玄挺运，谁能悟冥趣。\n落落天汉澄，俯仰即虚柔。\n七玄散幽夜，返胎顺沈浮。\n冥期苟潜凝，阳九无虞忧。\n覩此去来会，时复爲淹留。\n外身而身存，真仙会良俦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56096.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56096","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}